Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?feat(system-prompt):=20agent.system=5Fprompt=5F?=
 =?UTF-8?q?override=20=E6=9E=81=E7=AE=80=E6=A8=A1=E5=BC=8F=EF=BC=88?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=E6=95=B4=E6=AE=B5=E6=9B=BF=E6=8D=A2=20system=EF=BC=89?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
